1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:04,034
NARRATOR: Monday morning. A company discovers an intrusion.

2
00:00:04,584 --> 00:00:06,684
CEO: How did we miss this?

3
00:00:07,234 --> 00:00:10,264
CISO: We had alerts. Too many to investigate in time.

4
00:00:10,814 --> 00:00:16,354
NARRATOR: Attackers can use AI to move faster. Defenders need help connecting the clues.

5
00:00:16,904 --> 00:00:21,114
ENGINEER: Give me evidence I can trust, not another mountain of alerts.

6
00:00:21,664 --> 00:00:31,294
NARRATOR: In an isolated training lab, the agentic pentest proof of concept groups scanner findings and uses AI to propose the next action.

7
00:00:31,844 --> 00:00:33,944
CISO: And who controls the tools?

8
00:00:34,494 --> 00:00:37,865
ENGINEER: A fixed policy gate. The model never gets them.

9
00:00:38,415 --> 00:00:41,874
NARRATOR: People review the findings. The audit keeps the trail.
